{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_0156t8HwVAxPLkHVPufSUx2L", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Signed off. The session has ended."}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "88eb3ffe-d850-46b1-af75-8e5e4db34967", "uuid": "3392f23e-c12d-4725-a594-e930103ed42f", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T00:26:42.448Z", "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_0156t8HwVAxPLkHVPufSUx2L", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "config", "reason_type": "rule"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1sWZAxee8bFnFGYMt2e", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off with a PASS verdict at 0.5 confidence. Two reports I filed were not reproduced by the developer, and I could not verify the trade-in payout cap, so the sweep is not a clean bill of health.\n\n**Checked and working**\n- **Keep one of each item toggle:** stays on after leaving the Shop and after backgrounding the app. It changes what Sell Old Gear offers: with it on, Bronze Axe ×1 and Iron Sword ×2 (total 149); with it off, the single-item gear is included. I restored it to off, its starting state.\n- **Shop header:** 2,567,890 coins shows as \"2.6M\", which is consistent.\n- **Skills overview:** levels match the preconditions (Mining 50, Smithing 19 at 4,400 XP, Prayer 45, Mercantile 99). Combat tiles also match (Attack, Strength, Defense and Hitpoints 70; Ranged and Magic 40). Prestige markers show correctly.\n- **Cross-screen consistency:** Total Level 720 agrees with Home and Profile, and the Skills levels sum to it.\n- **Sell tab:** Price and Quantity sorts are ordered correctly, search filters correctly, and Sell Junk's total (486) is right.\n\n**Filed but not reproduced by the developer**\n1. **Sell Old Gear total (keep-one off):** the visible rows sum to 5,198, but the Total reads 5,416. The 218 difference equals Steel Full Helmet, which I could not scroll to. This is the most likely real bug, but it is unconfirmed.\n2. **Landscape clipping:** on the Shop Sell tab and the Skills overview, right-hand content runs under the system navigation strip.\n\n**Not verified**\n- **Trade-in payout cap:** I had no catalogue figure on screen to compare the payouts against. Logs sell for 6 against a buy price of 7, which is consistent with a cap but does not prove one.\n- **Save persistence after a real restart:** I could only background and reopen the app, not kill the process.\n\n**Noticed, outside the sweep**\n- The Profile screen shows \"[Debug] Set XP\" buttons on every skill. These look like test controls that should not ship in a release build.\n- The Skills tab label reads \"Skills (1)\" with no active session, and I could not work out what the count means."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 697, "cache_read_input_tokens": 236466, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 697}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "88eb3ffe-d850-46b1-af75-8e5e4db34967", "uuid": "ee34bb32-3210-4625-88e1-75049d805625", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T00:26:46.535Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch1sWYsqgueNYNruYm1SA"}
